      "writtenOn": "2025-11-11T09:18:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: In `trace_vmexit_end`, we only use it if the vcpu is host. But here RAX is saved regardless vcpu is host or guest. Maybe only save RAX for host vcpu?",
      "revId": "848d7518695ba9873464f8c99929625ce59083d8",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
