      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-12T00:36:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As saving RAX is pretty simple and fast, there might not be actual benefit of performance but may be more consistent with the code of checking RAX in `trace_vmexit_end`. I am fine with either way.",
      "parentUuid": "e5591ffc_46d753e2",
      "revId": "848d7518695ba9873464f8c99929625ce59083d8",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
