      "writtenOn": "2025-11-12T11:33:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, so I\u0027d prefer to keep saving it in both cases, since it actually seems a bit more consistent: even though we don\u0027t use it for guest vcpu, it is still the correct value of RAX for a guest vcpu as well; whereas if we don\u0027t save it, perf-\u003erax will not be the actual RAX value.",
